If you feel like taking the plunge, Slash-em has deep dragons which
confer level-resistance in their scales. (It also has shimmering
dragons for displacement.)

Also, next time you find a black dragon corpse, eat it for
disintegration resistance and swap your scales for yellow, gray or
silver. Former gives you a resistance you won't get in any way, it's
fairly minor but cool to have, the latter two mean both that you
double-up on MR or reflection meaning if one source is stolen or
destroyed you'll still have the other, and it also means if you find
something better to put in that other slot you can.



